{"id": "fh-0101", "domain": "online bakery order flow", "names": ["Order", "Bake", "Pack", "Ship", "Refund"], "text": "Morning! I'm sketching the online bakery order flow so the dev team can see it. Order comes first, then Bake, then Pack, and finally Ship. Connect them in that order please. If a customer cancels, the order goes to Refund, but that's a rare case. Make Refund red so it stands out. Put Ship at the far right. Hmm, can you make Pack a square? Is there a path from Order to Ship? Move Refund below Bake. What is the most connected shape? Which shapes are linked to Pack? Rename Bake to Oven, the bakers call it that. Show me how many arrows we have. Thanks!", "wires": [{"span": "Connect them in that order", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Order,Bake,Pack,Ship", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "the order goes to Refund", "trigger": "goes to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Order", "to": "Refund"}}, {"span": "Make Refund red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Refund", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Put Ship at the far right", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Ship", "position": "right"}}, {"span": "make Pack a square", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pack", "shape": "square"}}, {"span": "Is there a path from Order to Ship", "trigger": "Is there a path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Order", "to": "Ship"}}, {"span": "Move Refund below Bake", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Refund", "position": "below", "anchor": "Bake"}}, {"span": "What is the most connected shape", "trigger": "most connected", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Which shapes are linked to Pack", "trigger": "linked to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Pack"}}, {"span": "Rename Bake to Oven", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Bake", "name": "Oven"}}, {"span": "Show me how many arrows we have", "trigger": "how many arrows", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0102", "domain": "hiking trail map", "names": ["Trailhead", "Lake", "Summit", "Camp"], "text": "Trailhead is at the bottom. Connect Trailhead to Camp and Camp to Summit. Make the Summit gold. Is Lake bigger than Camp? Thanks!", "wires": [{"span": "Trailhead is at the bottom", "trigger": "is at", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Trailhead", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Connect Trailhead to Camp and Camp to Summit", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Trailhead,Camp,Summit", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Make the Summit gold", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Summit", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "Is Lake bigger than Camp", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Lake", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Camp"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0103", "domain": "game main menu", "names": ["Play", "Options", "Quit"], "text": "Put Quit under Options. Make Play green and Options gray. Which shape is the leftmost one?", "wires": [{"span": "Put Quit under Options", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Quit", "position": "below", "anchor": "Options"}}, {"span": "Make Play green", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Play", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Options gray", "trigger": "Options", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Options", "color": "gray"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the leftmost one", "trigger": "leftmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0104", "domain": "office wifi topology", "names": ["Ap1", "Ap2", "Switch", "Modem", "Router"], "text": "Hi, I'm drawing the office wifi setup for the IT meeting tomorrow. Modem feeds Switch, and Switch connects to both Ap1 and Ap2. Is Ap2 directly linked to Modem? Move Ap2 to the right of Ap1. Router should sit above Modem. Make the Router blue. Hmm, actually make the Router navy because it is the main box. Connect Router to Modem with a dotted line. Which shape is the leftmost? Can you count how many arrows we have now? Rename Switch to CoreSwitch because that's the name in the inventory. Thanks, I'll print this.", "wires": [{"span": "Modem feeds Switch", "trigger": "feeds", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Modem", "to": "Switch"}}, {"span": "Switch connects to both Ap1 and Ap2", "trigger": "connects to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Switch", "to": "Ap1,Ap2"}}, {"span": "Is Ap2 directly linked to Modem", "trigger": "directly linked", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Ap2", "anchor": "Modem"}}, {"span": "Move Ap2 to the right of Ap1", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Ap2", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Ap1"}}, {"span": "Router should sit above Modem", "trigger": "should sit above", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Router", "position": "above", "anchor": "Modem"}}, {"span": "make the Router navy", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Router", "color": "navy"}}, {"span": "Connect Router to Modem with a dotted line", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Router", "to": "Modem", "style": "dotted", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the leftmost", "trigger": "leftmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}, {"span": "count how many arrows we have now", "trigger": "count how many arrows", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}, {"span": "Rename Switch to CoreSwitch", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Switch", "name": "CoreSwitch"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0105", "domain": "volunteer schedule", "names": ["Mon", "Tue", "Wed", "Thu", "Fri"], "text": "Put the weekdays in a row, Mon first. Make Wed teal, I'm off that day. Is Fri the rightmost? Count how many days are shaded. Hmm no, just count the shapes.", "wires": [{"span": "Put the weekdays in a row", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Mon,Tue,Wed,Thu,Fri", "layout": "row"}}, {"span": "Make Wed teal", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Wed", "color": "teal"}}, {"span": "Is Fri the rightmost", "trigger": "rightmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}, {"span": "just count the shapes", "trigger": "count", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
