{"id": "fh-0112", "domain": "tube line sketch", "names": ["Central", "Victoria", "Piccadilly", "Jubilee"], "text": "Connect Central to Victoria, Piccadilly and Jubilee in one go. Make Central huge. What's the shortest path from Victoria to Jubilee?", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Central to Victoria, Piccadilly and Jubilee", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Central", "to": "Victoria,Piccadilly,Jubilee"}}, {"span": "Make Central huge", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Central", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "What's the shortest path from Victoria to Jubilee", "trigger": "shortest path", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Victoria", "to": "Jubilee"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0113", "domain": "basic flowchart for a class", "names": ["Input", "Process", "Output", "Log"], "text": "Okay so the input goes to the process, I'm making a basic flowchart for a class. Connect Input to Process and Process to Output. Make Process a blue rectangle. What can be reached from Input? Add a diamond named Error below Process. Make it red. Connect Process to Error with a dashed line. Log sits to the right of Output, put it there. Is Error bigger than Log? Move Log a bit up, around 20 pixels. Which shape has the fewest connections? Also, can you describe the whole diagram for my notes? Thanks, the class is tomorrow.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Input to Process and Process to Output", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Input,Process,Output", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Make Process a blue rectangle", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Process", "color": "blue", "shape": "rectangle"}}, {"span": "What can be reached from Input", "trigger": "What can be reached from", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Input"}}, {"span": "Add a diamond named Error below Process", "trigger": "Add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "diamond", "name": "Error", "position": "below", "anchor": "Process"}}, {"span": "Make it red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Connect Process to Error with a dashed line", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Process", "to": "$new", "style": "dashed", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "Log sits to the right of Output, put it there", "trigger": "sits to the right of", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Log", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Output"}}, {"span": "Is Error bigger than Log", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Log"}}, {"span": "Move Log a bit up, around 20 pixels", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Log", "direction": "up", "distance": "20"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the fewest connections", "trigger": "fewest connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leastConnected"}}, {"span": "describe the whole diagram for my notes", "trigger": "describe the whole diagram", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe"}}]}
