{"id": "fh-0116", "domain": "repo module graph", "names": ["Core", "Utils", "App", "Tests", "Docs"], "text": "I'm drawing how our repo modules link together so new people can find their way. Connect App to Core and Utils. Connect Tests to App. Docs should be a dashed box below Tests. Hmm, boxes can't be dashed, make it a gray box. Move Docs below Tests. Is there a cycle in this graph? How many arrows touch App? Which shape is the most connected? Also check whether Utils is directly linked to Tests. Make Core huge, it's the foundation. Rename Utils to Helpers, that's the name in the readme. Thanks, I'll paste the picture into the wiki.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect App to Core and Utils", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "App", "to": "Core,Utils"}}, {"span": "Connect Tests to App", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tests", "to": "App"}}, {"span": "make it a gray box", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Docs", "color": "gray", "shape": "rectangle"}}, {"span": "Move Docs below Tests", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Docs", "position": "below", "anchor": "Tests"}}, {"span": "Is there a cycle in this graph", "trigger": "Is there a cycle", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}, {"span": "How many arrows touch App", "trigger": "How many arrows touch", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "App"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the most connected", "trigger": "most connected", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "check whether Utils is directly linked to Tests", "trigger": "directly linked to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Utils", "anchor": "Tests"}}, {"span": "Make Core huge", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Core", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Rename Utils to Helpers", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Utils", "name": "Helpers"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0117", "domain": "emergency room flow", "names": ["Triage", "Surgery", "Waiting", "Discharge"], "text": "Make Surgery red. Triage goes into Surgery and Waiting. Discharge is the last step, put it at the bottom right. Which shape is the most connected?", "wires": [{"span": "Make Surgery red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Surgery", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Triage goes into Surgery and Waiting", "trigger": "goes into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Triage", "to": "Surgery,Waiting"}}, {"span": "put it at the bottom right", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Discharge", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the most connected", "trigger": "most connected", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
