{"id": "fh-0119", "domain": "shop floor map", "names": ["Door", "Till", "Shelf"], "text": "Is the Door bigger than the Till? Make the Till medium. Delete the Shelf.", "wires": [{"span": "Is the Door bigger than the Till", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Door", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Till"}}, {"span": "Make the Till medium", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Till", "size": "medium"}}, {"span": "Delete the Shelf", "trigger": "Delete", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Shelf"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0120", "domain": "telephone game for a class", "names": ["Ring", "Ann", "Ben", "Cy", "Dee"], "text": "Kids game idea: a phone chain where each person whispers to the next one. I'm drawing it on the canvas to explain it to my class. Connect Ring, Ann, Ben and Cy, each one to the next. Dee should be the last person, put her at the bottom right. Is Ann linked to Cy? Make Ring green so the kids know where it starts. Make Dee red because she is the end. Which shape is the farthest from Ring? Duplicate Ben once, we need an extra player. Hmm, I can't move a copy, just skip that. Ask me about the chain later. Thanks, you are a great help to a teacher.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Ring, Ann, Ben and Cy, each one to the next", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ring,Ann,Ben,Cy", "pairing": "next"}}, {"span": "put her at the bottom right", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Dee", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"span": "Is Ann linked to Cy", "trigger": "linked to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Ann", "anchor": "Cy"}}, {"span": "Make Ring green", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ring", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Make Dee red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dee", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the farthest from Ring", "trigger": "farthest from", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Ring", "superlative": "farthest"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Ben once", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Ben"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0121", "domain": "exam seating", "names": ["Row1", "Row2", "Row3"], "text": "Align Row1, Row2 and Row3 horizontally. Show a list of all the rectangles.", "wires": [{"span": "Align Row1, Row2 and Row3 horizontally", "trigger": "Align", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Row1,Row2,Row3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "Show a list of all the rectangles", "trigger": "Show a list of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "rectangle"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0122", "domain": "sculpture garden", "names": ["Statue", "Fountain", "Bench", "Tree", "Gate"], "text": "I'm planning a small sculpture garden for the town fair, and I'll test the layout here. Put the Fountain in the center, it's the centerpiece. Bench should be near the Fountain. Move Tree to the left of Bench. Make the Statue huge, people should see it from the gate. Gate goes at the bottom center. Is Tree left of Bench? Which shape is the biggest one? Connect Gate to Statue with a dotted path. Hmm, I'll rethink the path later. Rename Bench to Seat, the council calls it that. How many things are in the garden now? Undo the last move if the tree looks wrong. Thanks!", "wires": [{"span": "Put the Fountain in the center", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fountain", "position": "center"}}, {"span": "Bench should be near the Fountain", "trigger": "should be near", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bench", "position": "near", "anchor": "Fountain"}}, {"span": "Move Tree to the left of Bench", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tree", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Bench"}}, {"span": "Make the Statue huge", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Statue", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Gate goes at the bottom center", "trigger": "goes at", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Gate", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Is Tree left of Bench", "trigger": "Is Tree left of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Tree", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Bench"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the biggest one", "trigger": "biggest", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}, {"span": "Connect Gate to Statue with a dotted path", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gate", "to": "Statue", "style": "dotted"}}, {"span": "Rename Bench to Seat", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Bench", "name": "Seat"}}, {"span": "How many things are in the garden now", "trigger": "How many things", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}, {"span": "Undo the last move", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
