{"id": "fh-0127", "domain": "quiz branching", "names": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Result"], "text": "Q1 leads to Q2 if yes. Connect Q1 to Q2 and Q2 to Q3. Q3 goes to Result. Rename Result to Score. How many shapes do we have? Thanks.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Q1 to Q2 and Q2 to Q3", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Q1,Q2,Q3", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Q3 goes to Result", "trigger": "goes to", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Q3", "to": "Result"}}, {"span": "Rename Result to Score", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Result", "name": "Score"}}, {"span": "How many shapes do we have", "trigger": "How many shapes", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
