{"id": "fh-0129", "domain": "city block for geography homework", "names": ["Park", "School", "Museum", "Cafe", "Bank"], "text": "I'm sketching a city block for a geography homework, and my teacher wants the map to look neat. Put the Museum at the top left. Is the Park the biggest shape? Which shape is closest to the Cafe? Hmm, I think it's the Bank. Make the Bank gold so it stands out. Connect Park to School and School to Museum. Move Cafe a bit to the right, around 30 pixels. Are Cafe and Bank linked to each other? Duplicate Park two times for the other two parks in town. Show me the list of all the squares. Thanks, my teacher will be happy with this.", "wires": [{"span": "Put the Museum at the top left", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Museum", "position": "topLeft"}}, {"span": "Is the Park the biggest shape", "trigger": "biggest", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}, {"span": "Which shape is closest to the Cafe", "trigger": "closest to", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Cafe", "superlative": "closest"}}, {"span": "Make the Bank gold", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bank", "color": "gold"}}, {"span": "Connect Park to School and School to Museum", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Park,School,Museum", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Move Cafe a bit to the right, around 30 pixels", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cafe", "direction": "right", "distance": "30"}}, {"span": "Are Cafe and Bank linked to each other", "trigger": "Are Cafe and Bank linked", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Cafe", "anchor": "Bank"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Park two times", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Park", "count": "2"}}, {"span": "Show me the list of all the squares", "trigger": "Show me the list of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "square"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0130", "domain": "color test", "names": ["X1", "X2"], "text": "Make X1 navy. Make X2 teal.", "wires": [{"span": "Make X1 navy", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "X1", "color": "navy"}}, {"span": "Make X2 teal", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "X2", "color": "teal"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0131", "domain": "cloud network review", "names": ["Vpc", "Subnet1", "Subnet2", "Nat", "Igw", "Lb"], "text": "Hi, I'm documenting our network layout for a security review next week, so precision matters. Put Igw above Vpc, it's the entry point. Subnet1 and Subnet2 are the private subnets, so connect them to Nat. Nat should connect to Igw too. Is Lb linked to anything? Make Lb a red hexagon, it's the public entry point. Move Subnet2 to the right of Subnet1. Oops, I want the subnets in a column instead, so arrange them in a column. Which shape has the least connections? Duplicate Nat once so we have a backup. Rename Igw to Gateway. Connect Lb to Gateway with a dashed line. How many connections do we have in total? Thanks, this is very helpful.", "wires": [{"span": "Put Igw above Vpc", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Igw", "position": "above", "anchor": "Vpc"}}, {"span": "connect them to Nat", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Subnet1,Subnet2", "to": "Nat"}}, {"span": "Nat should connect to Igw too", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Nat", "to": "Igw"}}, {"span": "Is Lb linked to anything", "trigger": "linked to anything", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Lb"}}, {"span": "Make Lb a red hexagon", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Lb", "color": "red", "shape": "hexagon"}}, {"span": "arrange them in a column", "trigger": "arrange", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Subnet1,Subnet2", "layout": "column"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the least connections", "trigger": "least connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leastConnected"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Nat once", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Nat"}}, {"span": "Rename Igw to Gateway", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Igw", "name": "Gateway"}}, {"span": "Connect Lb to Gateway with a dashed line", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lb", "to": "Gateway", "style": "dashed", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "How many connections do we have in total", "trigger": "How many connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0132", "domain": "login states", "names": ["Locked", "Unlocked"], "text": "Make Locked red. Unlocked is green. Connect Locked to Unlocked with an arrow both ways.", "wires": [{"span": "Make Locked red", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Locked", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Unlocked is green", "trigger": "is", "type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Unlocked", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Connect Locked to Unlocked with an arrow both ways", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Locked", "to": "Unlocked", "arrow": "both"}}]}
