{"id": "fh-0134", "domain": "rocket stage plan", "names": ["Booster", "Payload", "Engine"], "text": "Stack the Payload above the Booster. Engine must be below the Booster. Is Payload above Booster? Yes? Good, thanks.", "wires": [{"span": "Stack the Payload above the Booster", "trigger": "Stack", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Payload", "position": "above", "anchor": "Booster"}}, {"span": "Engine must be below the Booster", "trigger": "must be below", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Engine", "position": "below", "anchor": "Booster"}}, {"span": "Is Payload above Booster", "trigger": "Is Payload above", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Payload", "position": "above", "anchor": "Booster"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0135", "domain": "neural network workshop", "names": ["In1", "In2", "Hidden", "Out", "Bias"], "text": "I'm drawing a tiny neural network for a workshop, and the slides need to match exactly. Connect In1 and In2 to Hidden. Connect Hidden to Out. Bias should feed into Hidden too. Make Out purple. Is there a cycle? Also, how many arrows are there in total? Move Bias above In1. Hmm, that might overlap, put it to the left of In1 instead. Which shape is the most connected? Make Hidden a large circle. Rename Out to Output because the slides say output. Undo the rename if the slides use the short name. Thanks, see you Friday.", "wires": [{"span": "Connect In1 and In2 to Hidden", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "In1,In2", "to": "Hidden"}}, {"span": "Connect Hidden to Out", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Hidden", "to": "Out"}}, {"span": "Bias should feed into Hidden", "trigger": "feed into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bias", "to": "Hidden"}}, {"span": "Make Out purple", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Out", "color": "purple"}}, {"span": "Is there a cycle", "trigger": "Is there a cycle", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}, {"span": "how many arrows are there in total", "trigger": "how many arrows", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}, {"span": "put it to the left of In1 instead", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bias", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "In1"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the most connected", "trigger": "most connected", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Make Hidden a large circle", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Hidden", "size": "large", "shape": "circle"}}, {"span": "Rename Out to Output", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Out", "name": "Output"}}, {"span": "Undo the rename", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0136", "domain": "pool rules sketch", "names": ["Ball", "Net", "Court"], "text": "From now on circles are red. Make Court huge. Is Ball red?", "wires": [{"span": "From now on circles are red", "trigger": "From now on", "type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "circle", "color": "red"}}, {"span": "Make Court huge", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Court", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Is Ball red", "trigger": "Is Ball red", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Ball", "color": "red"}}]}
